{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/5728","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/5728/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/5728/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/5728/events","html_url":"https://github.com/vuejs/core/issues/5728","id":1205748033,"node_id":"I_kwDOCCum185H3kFB","number":5728,"title":"bug(ssr): slot tag without default value will render different result between server and client","user":{"login":"zhangyuang","id":17424434,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDI0NDM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17424434?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangyuang","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangyuang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangyuang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangyuang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangyuang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangyuang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangyuang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangyuang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangyuang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangyuang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangyuang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":962500786,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NjI1MDA3ODY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/labels/:lady_beetle:%20%20bug","name":":lady_beetle:  bug","color":"fcba03","default":false,"description":"Something isn't working"},{"id":2185819480,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMTg1ODE5NDgw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/labels/scope:%20ssr","name":"scope: ssr","color":"7441a8","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2022-04-15T17:33:59Z","updated_at":"2023-09-26T00:19:15Z","closed_at":"2022-05-19T04:35:36Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Version\r\n3.2.33\r\n\r\n### Reproduction link\r\n[github.com](https://github.com/zhangyuang/vue-ssr-slot-bug)\r\n\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n1、git clone https://github.com/zhangyuang/vue-ssr-slot-bug.git\r\n2、pnpm i && pnpm start:vite\r\n\r\n### What is expected?\r\nHydrate succeed\r\n\r\n### What is actually happening?\r\nruntime-core.esm-bundler.js:4072 Hydration completed but contains mismatches\r\n\r\n<img width=\"722\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17424434/163602363-ca45069f-fd08-4297-92e1-752abfab0b35.png\">\r\n\r\nIf i have a slot component hope render fallback value if parent don't provide any slot content,\r\n```js\r\n<template>\r\n  <slot>\r\n    {{ title }}\r\n  </slot>\r\n</template>\r\n\r\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\r\nimport { defineProps, ref } from 'vue'\r\n\r\nconst props = defineProps<{\r\n  title?: string,\r\n}>()\r\nconst title = ref(props.title)\r\n</script>\r\n\r\n```\r\nBut if parent don't provide `props.title` to slot will cause hydrate error\r\n```js\r\n<template>\r\n  <div class=\"foo\">\r\n    <Foo />\r\n  </div>\r\n</template>\r\n\r\n<script lang=\"ts\" setup>\r\nimport Foo from './slot.vue'\r\n</script>\r\n\r\n``` \r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\nWith debug in source code, when hydrate dom, the server side node be regard as fragment but in the client side , the slot.vue will be compile text node which cause mismatch。\r\n\r\nref:\r\nhttps://github.com/vuejs/core/blob/main/packages/runtime-core/src/hydration.ts#L108\r\n\r\n<!-- generated by vue-issues. DO NOT REMOVE -->","closed_by":{"login":"yyx990803","id":499550,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTU1MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/499550?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803","html_url":"https://github.com/yyx990803","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/5728/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/5728/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}